       "text": "I haven't entered this order. 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day, which is twice the usual maximum for ibuprofen.\n\n- **Daily maximum:** The usual maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use under supervision. Many references use 2,400 mg/day for routine use.\n- **Single dose:** 1,600 mg in one dose is double the usual 800 mg maximum. Doses at this level carry a substantial risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even when kidney and liver function are normal.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- 1,600 mg total per day, divided into smaller doses\n\nIf you do want 1,600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly. I'd also suggest adding a note with your rationale. Otherwise, tell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it."
